  "metadata": {
    "title": "Workflow 0 - Pipeline Test (Single Image)",
    "description": "Smoke test: loads all core models, generates 1 image with 2-step refinement, SeedVR2 upscales to 2048px. No FaceDetailer (skip SDXL dependency). If a model fails to load, ComfyUI will tell you exactly which one is missing.",
    "version": "1.0",
    "author": "AI Influencer Pipeline",
    "gpu_target": "RTX 5090 32GB",
    "docker_image": "comfyui:latest-5090"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [50, 50],
      "size": [500, 260],
      "properties": {
        "text": "PIPELINE SMOKE TEST\n===================\nGenerates 1 test image to verify all models load correctly.\n\nMODELS TESTED:\n  - Z-Image UNet 6B (CivitAI) → unet/z_image_bf16.safetensors\n  - Qwen 3.4B CLIP (CivitAI) → clip/qwen_3_4b.safetensors\n  - UltraFlux VAE (CivitAI) → vae/ultraflux_vae.safetensors\n  - 3x Style LoRAs (CivitAI) → loras/\n  - SeedVR2 DiT 7B (HuggingFace) → SEEDVR2/seedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensors\n  - SeedVR2 VAE (HuggingFace) → SEEDVR2/ema_vae_fp16.safetensors\n\nPIPELINE: Gen 1024x1024 (20 steps) → Latent upscale 1.5x →\n  Refine (10 steps, denoise 0.2) → Decode → SeedVR2 upscale 2048px\n\nNOT TESTED HERE: FaceDetailer (needs SDXL checkpoint + YOLO model)\n  → Use workflow1/workflow2 for full pipeline test after this passes.\n\nIf any node errors, that model is missing. Check download_models.sh output."
      }
    },
    {
